    To the extent permitted by law, GoCore is not liable for any loss arising from your use of this website or reliance on its content. Nothing in these terms excludes rights you may have under the Australian Consumer Law that cannot be excluded.
  </p>

  <h2>Privacy</h2>
  <p>Our <a href="/privacy/">privacy policy</a> explains how we handle personal information.</p>

  <h2>Governing law and changes</h2>
  <p>
    These terms are governed by the laws of {SITE.jurisdiction}. We may update them from time to time; the date at the top of this page shows when they last changed.
